    leaderScript: "\"Mine's already on my door, go read it before you judge the activity. Six small true things, that's it. The rule I care about is that you do yours in front of your kids and you put it on the door next to theirs. If the adult cards end up on a separate wall, we've built a bulletin board instead of a school where people know each other.\"",
