    leaderScript: "\"We have four people new to this building this year. Every one of them has a partner, and I picked the partners on purpose. Here's the card, six things, thirty days, none of it is paperwork. Veterans, this is not a favor you're doing me. Nobody in this room learned how this place actually works from a handbook, they learned it from a person, and this year we're being deliberate about who that person is.\"",
