    objective: "Build one daily habit that gets you into classrooms for reasons that have nothing to do with evaluation, and make it visible enough that staff can count on it. Ten minutes, three or four rooms, one specific handwritten note left in each. The goal is not feedback and it is definitely not a walkthrough form. It is presence, delivered on a schedule, until your staff stops flinching when your shadow crosses the door.",
